Engineered a Random Forest machine learning classification model using Scikit-Learn to predict patient diabetes risk, achieving a 76% accuracy score.
Conducted Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) using Matplotlib to visually identify and filter structurally impossible data points, improving model reliability.
Implemented Explainable AI (XAI) protocols by extracting feature importance and statistical correlations, successfully proving to stakeholders that the model prioritized Glucose and BMI risk factors.
